c-ul-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UL 2019 Q4","e":"ul","d":"2020-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Jope","x":"But what I said on commodity inflation would suggest that it will be, if there is such a thing as a normal year of price increases in Unilever, then that's how we're characterizing 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/unilever-plc-ul-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UL 2019 Q4","e":"ul","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Jope","x":"We expect continued improvement in underlying operating margin, remaining on track for our 2020 goals, and that of course will be delivered through our focus on waste and inefficiencies and through restructuring investment that takes out cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/unilever-plc-ul-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UL 2019 Q4","e":"ul","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin Deboo","x":"You've got -- good news is there's further cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/unilever-plc-ul-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UL 2020 Q2","e":"ul","d":"2020-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Graeme Pitkethly","x":"Underlying sales declined by 2.7% in Asia/AMET/RUB, with volume decline of 2.9% and positive pricing of 0.2%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/unilever-plc-ul-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UL 2020 Q2","e":"ul","d":"2020-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan Jope","x":"The headwind is that eventually low oil prices will pass through to lower virgin resin pricing and that makes the differential between virgin resin and post-consumer use recycled material greater.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/unilever-plc-ul-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"UL 2020 Q2","e":"ul","d":"2020-0